{\b Timelapse Switch, a plugin for OBS Studio}\par
\par
{\b To install:} close OBS Studio, tick "I accept" below and click Install. That is all.\par
\par
Switch between real time and timelapse while you record. When you press Stop, the video is finished.\par
\par
{\b Free and open source.} Timelapse Switch is free software under the GNU General Public License, version 2 or (at your option) any later version. You may use it for anything, share it and change it. It never asks for money.\par
