\par
{\b What this installer does:} it puts the plugin into OBS Studio's plugin folder, C:\\ProgramData\\obs-studio\\plugins\\timelapse-switch. Nothing else on your computer changes. To remove it later: Windows Settings > Apps > Installed apps > Timelapse Switch for OBS Studio > Uninstall.\par
\par
Source code, guide and help: https://miguetronic.github.io/timelapse-switch/\par
